    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Satruda.\n1/30\nMETROPOLITAN HOTEL\nNANKING\nOrbs dearest -\nT. g. 10o came up her last\nniget at my requast and today\nhe called on a frend of his who\ncan do us a lat of good while\nI worked on the ones I know.\nT.g. wint back on the aftunson\ntrain and I am staying our\nto the the Pecks and Johnsons\ntomorrow and hair lunch\nwilk the Asst. L.g. of P. on\nmonday. Hope\nto lear monday\napennson late lay train for\nStanghai - be thane Tuesday\nand widnada, and fe, to\nHongkong Thrusday to stay\nsouth untie after the next\nsssion of the Koumintang\non til 15K when 9 hopr",
      "eir shale hour a less unreason-\nable nur trinist of communcatin\nto deal with.\n2 may decide\nwack out Entirely on our\nChinese frends and lear\nBond in change. He cant\ndo any worse than I hair\nand what's the use wasting\ntime on them.\nAm having tiffin tomorrows,\nSunday\nwith Vic-minter Peng who\nis the new Chairman of the\nBoard of CNAC.\nLatu - Sunday night. Ears.\nthis morning\nI got a chit from\nFing sayung that he ha\nad bean\nCalend to\nShanghai and Coned\nnot kep his tiffin appointment.\nI then called up thr fick and\nhe invited me ant for luner\nand very kindl, had the johnsons\nalso...\nIt was a waffle dennu!"
    ],
